direct-rdp (0.5.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Have Macs send every change as it happens, as Apple's viewer does,
    instead of a few updates a second.
  * Show Macs in full quality by default, with a Picture Quality menu to
    switch to Adaptive on slow connections; the choice is saved.
  * Upload only the changed part of the screen when drawing.

 -- Lidan H <lidanh@gmail.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:04:58 +0200

direct-rdp (0.4.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Show Macs with Apple's own Adaptive picture encoding: 8x8 tiles that
    send a changed area coarsely at once and refine it after, a fraction of
    the data of plain VNC.

 -- Lidan H <lidanh@gmail.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 17:49:27 +0200

